cines we have today  it is really  comparing a a bicycle with the with the  space shuttle the the the orders of  complexity are are in those scales and  the world had never had a vaccine  against a human parasite not just  against malaria against any human  parasite  what impact will this vaccine roll out  have  on  africa  together with other interventions a  malaria vaccine will help us save tens  of thousands of lives hundreds of  thousands of lives  prevent  millions of cases and help us  regain momentum in the fight  against malaria it is of massive global  significance
 

